{"id":"illyuziya","lemma":"иллюзия","pos":"noun","rank":4110,"glosses":["illusion (anything that seems to be something that it is not)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB%D1%8E%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB%D1%8E%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"иллюзии","plural":"иллюзии"},"examples":[{"text":"Всё это была иллюзия?","en":"Was it all an illusion?","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Иллюзии не живут долго.","en":"Illusions are short lived.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728236","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"a long time"}]},{"text":"Говорят, мираж - это иллюзия.","en":"A mirage is said to be an illusion.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"mirage"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Это иллюзия?","en":"Is it an illusion?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Иллюзии долго не живут.","en":"Illusions are short lived.","words":[null,{"g":"a long time"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"}]}]}